{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":true,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1236,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904308,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1441706997,"LastPoster":{"Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1911294,"PostDate":1456335665,"PostContent":"We finally made a decision and you can follow us on our new feed at: \u00a0 http:\/\/www.bestdestination...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440838484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79573,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5699198aab87bef62e11c77c0dbca2fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!\n\n\nWe are looking at getting married in the Mayans and have looked a few resorts that fit our taste. So far the following resorts have rates that are reasonable for our guests: Moon Palace, New Sapphire and Royalton Riviera.&amp;nbsp; Moon Palace is bit pricer but we&#039;ve included on the list based on past experience with Palace Resorts. We would like to hear to your experiences of any these place.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far we we are leaning towards Royalton, but Moon Palace offers extra benefits that we can&#039;t leave off the list.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please share details, photos and fees that are usually not mentioned.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nYou can post on here on email me at: canadorecc@&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/&#039;&gt;gmail&lt;\/a&gt;.com\n\n\nThanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904308,"PostDate":1441706997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!<br><br>\nWe are looking at getting married in the Mayans and have looked a few resorts that fit our taste. So far the following resorts have rates that are reasonable for our guests: Moon Palace, New Sapphire and Royalton Riviera.\u00a0 Moon Palace is bit pricer but we've included on the list based on past experience with Palace Resorts. We would like to hear to your experiences of any these place.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far we we are leaning towards Royalton, but Moon Palace offers extra benefits that we can't leave off the list.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please share details, photos and fees that are usually not mentioned.<\/p>\n<p>\nYou can post on here on email me at: canadorecc@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>gmail<\/a>.com<br><br>\nThanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440838484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79573,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e80e2ccb3920eeb005cac9640d09161a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Canadorecc and Congrats on your dw in 2017!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great ideas, suggestions and support - so well done on getting off to an excellent start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To show you what Moon Palace or NOW Sapphire would look like as your photo backdrops, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured there recently.......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/11039138_10153122557789487_5349630109600643271_o.jpg\" alt=\"11039138_10153122557789487_5349630109600\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487359697_o.jpg\" alt=\"10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11046202_10153122560264487_2678276349822951496_o.jpg\" alt=\"11046202_10153122560264487_2678276349822\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1979934_10152285889214487_717876470_o.jpg\" alt=\"1979934_10152285889214487_717876470_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1276599_10152285891999487_1539749339_o.jpg\" alt=\"1276599_10152285891999487_1539749339_o.j\"&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1025772_10152285892949487_1938182328_o.jpg\" alt=\"1025772_10152285892949487_1938182328_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with uyour plans - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904318,"PostDate":1441711034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Canadorecc and Congrats on your dw in 2017!!! You've come to the right place for lots of great ideas, suggestions and support - so well done on getting off to an excellent start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To show you what Moon Palace or NOW Sapphire would look like as your photo backdrops, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured there recently.......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/11039138_10153122557789487_5349630109600643271_o.jpg\" alt=\"11039138_10153122557789487_5349630109600\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487359697_o.jpg\" alt=\"10446337_10153122558924487_4799204771487\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11046202_10153122560264487_2678276349822951496_o.jpg\" alt=\"11046202_10153122560264487_2678276349822\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1979934_10152285889214487_717876470_o.jpg\" alt=\"1979934_10152285889214487_717876470_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1276599_10152285891999487_1539749339_o.jpg\" alt=\"1276599_10152285891999487_1539749339_o.j\"><\/span>.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1025772_10152285892949487_1938182328_o.jpg\" alt=\"1025772_10152285892949487_1938182328_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with uyour plans - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79573,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39735cfcdc3e8e6c69444f7865b42744","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Canadorecc\"] Congrats and welcome! That&#039;s a lot of information you&#039;re asking for! My first question would be do you have a travel agent yet? That I think would be your best first step. Your TA will become you new best friend as you go through your planning journey and will help you and your guests with questions, bookings etc while you concentrate on your planning. There are several agents in Canada that the ladies have worked with and willing to recommend. Secondly, there may be group perks you&#039;re could be entitled to and a travel agent will assist you with that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re considering 3 very nice resorts and they have all been covered here in threads. I would highly recommend that you go to the top of the page to the search bar and just type in which resort you want and I know several threads will come up. Too many to list here. Take some time to read through them. The ladies here are very ready to share tips and ideas and I can guarantee that questions you have, have likely already been asked and answered in some way, shape or form on the various threads.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904485,"PostDate":1441901587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284608\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284608-canadorecc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Canadorecc<\/span><\/a> Congrats and welcome! That's a lot of information you're asking for! My first question would be do you have a travel agent yet? That I think would be your best first step. Your TA will become you new best friend as you go through your planning journey and will help you and your guests with questions, bookings etc while you concentrate on your planning. There are several agents in Canada that the ladies have worked with and willing to recommend. Secondly, there may be group perks you're could be entitled to and a travel agent will assist you with that.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're considering 3 very nice resorts and they have all been covered here in threads. I would highly recommend that you go to the top of the page to the search bar and just type in which resort you want and I know several threads will come up. Too many to list here. Take some time to read through them. The ladies here are very ready to share tips and ideas and I can guarantee that questions you have, have likely already been asked and answered in some way, shape or form on the various threads.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.36.49.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79573,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eab18219fb9f1eb4575ff38b5b3e78fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Canadorecc\"] I&#039;m also planning a destination wedding for 2017.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found a local wedding planner that specializes in destination weddings and she&#039;s pulled some rates for me already and our top picks were Now Sapphire and Azul Beach Hotel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know how things work out for you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906076,"PostDate":1444341028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284608\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284608-canadorecc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Canadorecc<\/span><\/a> I'm also planning a destination wedding for 2017.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found a local wedding planner that specializes in destination weddings and she's pulled some rates for me already and our top picks were Now Sapphire and Azul Beach Hotel.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know how things work out for you!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jess<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79659-jes0912-moon-palace-planning-thread\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79659-jes0912-moon-palace-planning-thread\/<\/a>","Email":"jessica.so@icloud.com","IpAddress":"70.36.49.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444260503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/