Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":206,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1911293,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1456335564,"LastPoster":{"Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":28,"Preview":{"Id":1911426,"PostDate":1456673649,"PostContent":"Congrats @Laur114 .\u00a0 Wish we of known about the bridal promotion.\u00a0 We would of loved to do a site...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440838484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.95.198.6","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cea3e5f75bd1366e0aee95c04e3f41c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It wasn&#039;t easy and it took lots of time to finally decide on a resort.&amp;nbsp; I would of never thought it would take this long to narrow down a resort, but there is so much to consider.&amp;nbsp; We had narrowed down the resorts to: Hard Rock Riviera, Moon Palace, Now Sapphire and Royalton Riviera.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Okay, it wasn&#039;t the fault of my finance to take long on making a decision - It was me lol.&amp;nbsp; She stated it was up to me, so I made sure I did my due diligence.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve read a number materials to make a decision such as: promotions, catalogs, tripadvisor and company website.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So, Today, we have finally made our wedding reservation and confirmed our wedding date for February 2017 at the Royalton Riviera Cancun.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We found that the resort meets most our needs and expectations.&amp;nbsp; There is a variety of food, lots to do and great area for kids.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything seems to be underway, we are just waiting for our wedding invitations that we just ordered lastnight.&amp;nbsp; We got our invitations made through vistaprint and hopefully they turn out great.&amp;nbsp; We had to jump on the invitations as they were half price.&amp;nbsp; The invitations only cost us about $115 for 250 including taxes and shipping.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone has details, photos or wedding experiences with Royalton Riviera, Please share.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911293,"PostDate":1456335564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It wasn't easy and it took lots of time to finally decide on a resort.\u00a0 I would of never thought it would take this long to narrow down a resort, but there is so much to consider.\u00a0 We had narrowed down the resorts to: Hard Rock Riviera, Moon Palace, Now Sapphire and Royalton Riviera.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Okay, it wasn't the fault of my finance to take long on making a decision - It was me lol.\u00a0 She stated it was up to me, so I made sure I did my due diligence.\u00a0 I've read a number materials to make a decision such as: promotions, catalogs, tripadvisor and company website.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So, Today, we have finally made our wedding reservation and confirmed our wedding date for February 2017 at the Royalton Riviera Cancun.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We found that the resort meets most our needs and expectations.\u00a0 There is a variety of food, lots to do and great area for kids.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything seems to be underway, we are just waiting for our wedding invitations that we just ordered lastnight.\u00a0 We got our invitations made through vistaprint and hopefully they turn out great.\u00a0 We had to jump on the invitations as they were half price.\u00a0 The invitations only cost us about $115 for 250 including taxes and shipping.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has details, photos or wedding experiences with Royalton Riviera, Please share.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440838484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.90.218.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"3d1b0aefff5638a2f12f61db59d3eb37","RawContent":"My wedding is booked for January 2017. My fianc\u00e9 and took advantage of their bridal promotion so we&#039;re going for 4 days in May. We have a tour and menu tasting scheduled. I CANNOT WAIT! I Check trip advisor daily for pics and reviews. I also have been checking to see if the hotel rates change because we have not booked a block of rooms yet. I found a wedding photographer who shot a wedding there. The website is below.\n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.adrianbonetphotography.net\/wedding-royalton-riviera-cancun-1\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.adrianbonetphotography.net\/wedding-royalton-riviera-cancun-1\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911308,"PostDate":1456352525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My wedding is booked for January 2017. My fianc\u00e9 and took advantage of their bridal promotion so we're going for 4 days in May. We have a tour and menu tasting scheduled. I CANNOT WAIT! I Check trip advisor daily for pics and reviews. I also have been checking to see if the hotel rates change because we have not booked a block of rooms yet. I found a wedding photographer who shot a wedding there. The website is below.<br><br>\n<a href='https:\/\/www.adrianbonetphotography.net\/wedding-royalton-riviera-cancun-1\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.adrianbo...viera-cancun-1\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurenandjason2017@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.90.218.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454541522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laur114","Id":286128,"Name":"Laur114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.98.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"eeaaa452a1a571a7339bbbf2df840fe7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If you do a search on @[member=\"maybeoneday\"] she had her wedding there last October and she provided a review in her planning thread. It&#039;s a gorgeous resort and she found the wedding coordinator good to work with.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911313,"PostDate":1456357099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>If you do a search on @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> she had her wedding there last October and she provided a review in her planning thread. It's a gorgeous resort and she found the wedding coordinator good to work with.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.235.107.159","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"7c064153dac8c8b8850158d93c1b77a4","RawContent":"Great choice @[member=\"Canadorecc\"] ! I&#039;m having my wedding there this May and can&#039;t wait! I had my site visit in August and loved every aspect of the  resort. The welcome monitor was the best b I&#039;ve ever had and we had a tour and lunch with the one of the wedding planning managers, Daniela and had an amazing time. The food at the buffet offered so many options and was beyond delicious. Everything I retired was good and everything offered was fresh. I&#039;ve been to a few other all-inclusives and the food here was no comparison. (I&#039;ve stayed at NOW JADE, the sister property to Now Sapphire and there really is no comparison to Royalton.) I&#039;m happy to share my experience with you if you&#039;d like. Ask away. I did not take any photos during the site visit, sorry to say, but I have had other brides share their pictures with me. What areas have you chosen for the ceremony and the reception?","Attachments":[],"Id":1911394,"PostDate":1456559339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great choice @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284608\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284608-canadorecc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Canadorecc<\/span><\/a> ! I'm having my wedding there this May and can't wait! I had my site visit in August and loved every aspect of the  resort. The welcome monitor was the best b I've ever had and we had a tour and lunch with the one of the wedding planning managers, Daniela and had an amazing time. The food at the buffet offered so many options and was beyond delicious. Everything I retired was good and everything offered was fresh. I've been to a few other all-inclusives and the food here was no comparison. (I've stayed at NOW JADE, the sister property to Now Sapphire and there really is no comparison to Royalton.) I'm happy to share my experience with you if you'd like. Ask away. I did not take any photos during the site visit, sorry to say, but I have had other brides share their pictures with me. What areas have you chosen for the ceremony and the reception?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rhonda3839@aol.com","IpAddress":"32.214.84.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433617517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283419.jpg?_r=1456626300","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Rhonda3839","Id":283419,"Name":"Rhonda3839","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.95.198.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e386291e78fc7d5c74b4758548fda6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats @[member=\"Laur114\"] .&amp;nbsp; Wish we of known about the bridal promotion.&amp;nbsp; We would of loved to do a site inspection so we could have a better idea of their menu.   We also haven&#039;t reserved a block of rooms yet as we are hoping for the price to drop.&amp;nbsp; I know sunwing is offering a promotion till Feb 29 so my finance and I have been debating whether to reserve the block of rooms or hold out and hopefully it goes down.&amp;nbsp; We haven&#039;t decided on what we are doing with Photos yet, whether to go with the resort photographer or friends.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for the info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"acw271011\"].&amp;nbsp; I have looked at trend and it has lots of information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"Rhonda3839\"] and Congrats!&amp;nbsp; We also considered the Jade and Sapphire but we didn&#039;t think it match the standard of the Royalton.&amp;nbsp; We have reserved the Chapel for the ceremony and the Sky Terrace for the reception.   Any help is greatly appreciated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Laur114\"] @[member=\"Rhonda3839\"].&amp;nbsp; How did you arrange to have a site visit and tour?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911426,"PostDate":1456673649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286128-laur114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laur114<\/span><\/a> .\u00a0 Wish we of known about the bridal promotion.\u00a0 We would of loved to do a site inspection so we could have a better idea of their menu.\u00a0\u00a0 We also haven't reserved a block of rooms yet as we are hoping for the price to drop.\u00a0 I know sunwing is offering a promotion till Feb 29 so my finance and I have been debating whether to reserve the block of rooms or hold out and hopefully it goes down.\u00a0 We haven't decided on what we are doing with Photos yet, whether to go with the resort photographer or friends.\u00a0 Thanks for the info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a>.\u00a0 I have looked at trend and it has lots of information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283419\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283419-rhonda3839\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rhonda3839<\/span><\/a> and Congrats!\u00a0 We also considered the Jade and Sapphire but we didn't think it match the standard of the Royalton.\u00a0 We have reserved the Chapel for the ceremony and the Sky Terrace for the reception.\u00a0\u00a0 Any help is greatly appreciated.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286128-laur114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laur114<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283419\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283419-rhonda3839\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rhonda3839<\/span><\/a>.\u00a0 How did you arrange to have a site visit and tour?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"canadorecc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.26.73.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440838484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Canadorecc","Id":284608,"Name":"Canadorecc","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79961","Title":"Royalton Riviera Wedding - Feb. 2017...booked","LastPostDate":1456673649},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
