{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":496,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1905221,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284764,"Name":"RoxMario","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1442938468,"LastPoster":{"Id":286090,"Name":"Natasha28","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1905221,"PostDate":1442938468,"PostContent":"I love this site & thank god i found it.. But at the same damn time I have to read tons just to h...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campos213@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.9.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441911257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxMario","Id":284764,"Name":"RoxMario","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.87.152","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1cfe57ab346f1970b0f13b2640ba343","RawContent":"I love this site &amp;amp; thank god i found it.. But at the same damn time I have to read tons just to have my one question answered, but by than I am already thinking of 10 more.. lol\n\n\nWe are planning on October 8 or 9 2016. Reception in JF but not sure on the ceremony. I am completely in love with the gazebo lobby. Not not sure if itll be more $. I am set to invite about 60 ppl but am hoping 2 have a buget of no more than $9000.00 usd does anyone think that is possible? \n\n\nCan i meet ppl who alreay had their wedding at PF and tell me there final price. Plwase help","Attachments":[],"Id":1905221,"PostDate":1442938468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love this site & thank god i found it.. But at the same damn time I have to read tons just to have my one question answered, but by than I am already thinking of 10 more.. lol<br><br>\nWe are planning on October 8 or 9 2016. Reception in JF but not sure on the ceremony. I am completely in love with the gazebo lobby. Not not sure if itll be more $. I am set to invite about 60 ppl but am hoping 2 have a buget of no more than $9000.00 usd does anyone think that is possible? <br><br>\nCan i meet ppl who alreay had their wedding at PF and tell me there final price. Plwase help \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campos213@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.9.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441911257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxMario","Id":284764,"Name":"RoxMario","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.75.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1642d54a5b6807199f957c9fc1e63113","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community RoxMario and Congrats on your JF wedding coming up in Oct next year!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of great ideas, suggestions, support and advice here, so well done on getting off to a wonderful start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera....to ramp up your creativity - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717087827_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563138609_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905261,"PostDate":1443001527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community RoxMario and Congrats on your JF wedding coming up in Oct next year!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great ideas, suggestions, support and advice here, so well done on getting off to a wonderful start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera....to ramp up your creativity - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>...taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717087827_o.jpg\" alt=\"11700881_10153435265859487_8330476870717\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563138609_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357262_10153362917524487_2748914616563\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.28.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a63341aa35a7b48493e5571cce5cf382","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow... looka here! Months later....I am having the same issue! I am sooooo torn! I&#039;m also in love with the Lobby, but I also love the beach setting and reception site at JF. I am really curious to know if you&#039;ve made a decision between the two, if so please share with me and how you made out with your budget for 60 guest. The reason I&#039;m asking is because I&#039;m in the process of comparing the rates, and so far.... just for 15-20 guest at JF, accommodations at Royalton, and air, I&#039;m around $8,600! That&#039;s not including the dress, photographer, hair, makeup, transportation, spending money, my husband&#039;s suit...etc. lol! So please...........let me know how you&#039;re making out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909215,"PostDate":1452363367,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow... looka here! Months later....I am having the same issue! I am sooooo torn! I'm also in love with the Lobby, but I also love the beach setting and reception site at JF. I am really curious to know if you've made a decision between the two, if so please share with me and how you made out with your budget for 60 guest. The reason I'm asking is because I'm in the process of comparing the rates, and so far.... just for 15-20 guest at JF, accommodations at Royalton, and air, I'm around $8,600! That's not including the dress, photographer, hair, makeup, transportation, spending money, my husband's suit...etc. lol! So please...........let me know how you're making out.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsmaxinehuggins@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.28.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452104486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285801.jpg?_r=1453401197","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"MrsH08","Id":285801,"Name":"MrsH08","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.81.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79608,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20765edcf1eb690a92dc190c56db419a","RawContent":"I am also having both ceremony and full reception at the royalton in October.  Budget is also $10000.  Please keep me in the loop as well. Thank you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1911120,"PostDate":1455992102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also having both ceremony and full reception at the royalton in October.  Budget is also 